  acmePropertyDeclaration = V"PROPERTY" * V"identifier" * (V"COLON" * V"acmePropertyTypeRef")^-1 * ((V"ASSIGN" * V"acmePropertyValueDeclaration") + (V"CONTAINASSIGN" * V"acmePropertyValueDeclaration"))^-1 * (V"acmePropertyBlock")^-1 * V"SEMICOLON",
  acmePropertyValueDeclaration = V"INTEGER_LITERAL" + ((V"MINUS" + V"PLUS")^0 * V"FLOATING_POINT_LITERAL") + V"STRING_LITERAL" + V"FALSE" + V"TRUE" + V"acmePropertySet" + V"acmePropertyRecord" + V"acmePropertySequence" + V"enumidentifier",
  enumidentifier = V"IDENTIFIER",
