  acmeViewDeclaration = V"VIEW" * V"identifier" * (V"COLON" * V"acmeViewTypeRef")^-1 * (V"SEMICOLON" + (V"ASSIGN" * ((V"acmeViewBody" * (V"SEMICOLON")^-1) + (V"NEW" * V"acmeViewInstantiatedTypeRef" * (V"SEMICOLON" + (V"EXTENDED" * V"WITH" * V"acmeViewBody" * (V"SEMICOLON")^-1)))))),
